  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "In Starry Sky grotto-heaven, after Filthy Mud Robe traps three flying sword rats and earth’s root spikes kill them, Shi Lei peels that robe onto a grotto-heaven loophole, presses both palms in, and feeds a large amount of immortal essence into the cover before casting this immortal killer move. He laughs, takes a huge step, and forces his way out through the opening.",
