    {
      "text": "The breakthrough is rough compared with Star Lord Wan Xiang’s methods: invisible force squeezes him from all sides as he leaves, and only his golden fur giant monkey form’s raised defense lets him push out while bleeding, especially from earlier flying sword rat wounds. Outside he finds five flying bears close in and six huge star shadows overhead; he is still inside Seven Star Child’s seven star space rather than free of the grotto-heaven.",
